  "correction_rules": [
    "Reduce forecast bias when sentiment is negative (sentiment < 0) — model tends to overestimate prices.",
    "Adjust downward for recent spikes (last 5-7 days) — model often overshoots after price peaks.",
    "Apply mean reversion correction if forecast is > 10% above recent 30-day average — especially when sentiment is neutral or positive.",
    "Increase forecast lag by 1-2 days if sentiment is positive — model reacts too quickly to sentiment signals.",
    "Lower forecast for early days of new sentiment trend — model overreacts to sentiment shifts within first 3-5 days."
